// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// PyArcana canonical capstone contracts — thirteen in total.
// Twelve principal level capstones (3 per level × 4 levels) plus one final
// transversal capstone. The N4-D request is folded into CP-N4-C with three
// sub-gates (S49/S50/S51); no fourteenth principal capstone is created.
//
// Briefs are handcrafted in the Stephen Fry register: elegant, warm, expansive,
// opening with an international anecdote that raises the question the capstone
// answers. No bulk generation. No placeholders.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

